```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    title: Customer Starts Laundry Session
    participant C as Customer App
    participant S as SpinCycle Backend
    participant P as Stripe API
    participant M as Laundry Machine (IoT)

    C->>+S: 1. Scans QR Code, requests machine details (QR_ID)
    S-->>-C: 2. Returns machine status and cycle options

    C->>+S: 3. Selects cycle, requests to start session
    S->>+P: 4. Create Payment Intent (Amount, Currency)
    P-->>-S: 5. Returns Payment Intent ID & Client Secret
    S-->>-C: 6. Forwards Client Secret to App

    C->>+P: 7. Confirms payment with card details (via Stripe Elements)
    P-->>-C: 8. Payment authorization result
    note right of S: Stripe sends `charge.succeeded` webhook asynchronously
    P-->>S: 9. Webhook: Payment Successful

    S->>S: 10. Verify webhook, create LaundrySession, log Transaction
    S->>M: 11. Command: Start Cycle (CycleTypeID)
    M->>M: 12. Cycle Starts
    M-->>S: 13. Publishes status change: RUNNING (via MQTT)

    S-->>-C: 14. Session started confirmation
```